    "summary": "Master Services Agreement with Bluewren Bank, Northwind's largest customer at about 28% of revenue. Clause 14.2 lets either party terminate on 30 days' notice after a direct or indirect change of control of the supplier.",
    "red_flags": [
      "Clause 14.2 gives Bluewren a termination right on 30 days' notice upon a change of control of Northwind. Bluewren is about 28% of revenue, so the transaction could put a large revenue stream at immediate risk.",
